# Gideon the Oathless has "Ward--Discard a card" (CR 702.21a). Bot2 bolts Gideon twice with a Mountain and a Mox Ruby: the
# first time it declines to discard and the Bolt is countered (Gideon survives, undamaged); the second time it discards an
# Island, the Bolt resolves and Gideon, a 3/3, dies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Gideon the Oathless
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Gideon the Oathless.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
