Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Gideon the Oathless)
Bot2.Decline
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Gideon the Oathless.Damage = 0
? Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Gideon the Oathless)
Bot2.Accept
Bot2.Choose(Island)
